~ start
DODONG: [speed=1.0]Hmph. Tatay made me put my Game Boy away. I was [wave amp=2 freq=3]this[/wave] close to beating that level, too![/speed]

DODONG: [speed=1.0][wave amp=2 freq=3]At least there's no school tomorrow. Maybe I'll finally get to play all day![/wave][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.9]But... what about the storm?[/speed]

DODONG: [speed=1.0]Tatay says it'll be fine. Our coconut trees have been through tons of storms already, so what's one more?[/speed]

DODONG: [speed=1.0]Anyway, your birthday's coming up! Think Nanay will really make that chocolate cake Ate Valerie was talking about?[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.9]I hope so...[/speed]

DODONG: [speed=1.0][wave amp=2 freq=3]Hey, maybe you'll let me have the biggest slice, huh?[/wave][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=1.0]But it's my birthday![/speed]

DODONG: [speed=1.0][wave amp=2 freq=3]Ha! I'm kidding![/wave] It's your birthday, after all![/speed]

DODONG: [speed=0.9]Don't worry so much, Ollie. We'll be fine. Trust Tatay.[/speed]

=> END